<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <%- include('partials/head') %>

    <!-- FAQ Structured Data -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What is AI Governance, Risk & Compliance (AI GRC)?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "AI Governance, Risk & Compliance (AI GRC) is the practice of establishing governance, identifying and managing AI-related risks, and helping organisations meet applicable legal, regulatory, industry, and internal requirements when using artificial intelligence."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Why does my organisation need AI governance?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "AI governance helps organisations understand how AI is being used, establish accountability, identify potential risks, improve oversight, and create responsible practices for the use of artificial intelligence."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What types of AI risks can SMK DIGITALS help identify?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS can help organisations identify risks related to privacy, data protection, security, bias, accuracy, transparency, human oversight, third-party vendors, operations, and reputation."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Can SMK DIGITALS help us create AI policies?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Yes. SMK DIGITALS can help organisations develop practical AI governance frameworks, acceptable-use policies, procedures, accountability structures, and responsible AI guidelines tailored to their organisation."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Does SMK DIGITALS provide legal advice?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS provides AI governance, risk, compliance readiness, and implementation support. When an engagement requires formal legal, privacy, cybersecurity, or other specialist professional advice, we work with qualified professionals."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How can my organisation start its AI governance journey?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "A practical starting point is an AI Governance Assessment. This helps identify how AI is currently being used, highlight governance and risk gaps, and provide a prioritised roadmap for improving responsible AI practices."
                }
            }
        ]
    }
    </script>

</head>

<body>

    <%- include('partials/navbar', { active: active }) %>

    <main>

        <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
        <section id="how-it-works">

            <h2>How Our AI GRC Process Works</h2>

            <p>
                We guide your organisation through a structured process to
                understand, manage, and govern AI responsibly.
            </p>

            <div class="flip-boxes-container">

                <!-- Step 1 -->
                <div class="flip-box">
                    <div class="flip-box-inner">

                        <div class="flip-box-front">
                            <h3>Step 1</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flip-box-back">
                            <h3>Assess &amp; Discover</h3>
                            <p>
                                We begin by understanding how your organisation
                                currently uses AI. We identify AI systems,
                                processes, data usage, stakeholders, vendors,
                                governance practices, and potential risks.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="flip-box">
                    <div class="flip-box-inner">

                        <div class="flip-box-front">
                            <h3>Step 2</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flip-box-back">
                            <h3>Manage &amp; Govern</h3>
                            <p>
                                We develop practical governance frameworks,
                                policies, risk controls, accountability
                                structures, and recommendations designed around
                                your organisation's AI use and risk profile.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="flip-box">
                    <div class="flip-box-inner">

                        <div class="flip-box-front">
                            <h3>Step 3</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flip-box-back">
                            <h3>Monitor &amp; Improve</h3>
                            <p>
                                AI governance is an ongoing process. We provide
                                continued monitoring, risk reviews, policy
                                updates, vendor assessments, and advisory support
                                to help your organisation maintain responsible AI
                                practices as technology evolves.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- FAQ -->
        <section id="FAQ">

            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

            <p>
                Find answers to common questions about our AI Governance, Risk &amp;
                Compliance services and approach.
            </p>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>
                    What is AI Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance (AI GRC)?
                    <span>▼</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    AI Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance (AI GRC) is the practice
                    of establishing governance, identifying and managing
                    AI-related risks, and helping organisations meet applicable
                    requirements when using artificial intelligence.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>
                    Why does my organisation need AI governance?
                    <span>▼</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    AI governance helps organisations understand how AI is being
                    used, establish accountability, identify risks, improve
                    oversight, and create responsible practices for AI adoption.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>
                    What types of AI risks can SMK DIGITALS help identify?
                    <span>▼</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We can help identify risks related to privacy, data protection,
                    security, bias, accuracy, transparency, human oversight,
                    third-party vendors, operations, and reputation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>
                    Can SMK DIGITALS help us create AI policies?
                    <span>▼</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    Yes. We can help develop AI governance frameworks,
                    acceptable-use policies, procedures, accountability
                    structures, and responsible AI guidelines tailored to your
                    organisation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>
                    Does SMK DIGITALS provide legal advice?
                    <span>▼</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    SMK DIGITALS provides AI governance, risk, compliance
                    readiness, and implementation support. When formal legal,
                    privacy, cybersecurity, or other specialist professional
                    expertise is required, we work with qualified professionals.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>
                    How can my organisation start its AI governance journey?
                    <span>▼</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    A practical starting point is an AI Governance Assessment.
                    This helps identify how AI is currently being used, highlight
                    governance and risk gaps, and provide a prioritised roadmap
                    for improving responsible AI practices.
                </p>
            </div>

            <a href="/contact" class="btn">
                Start Your AI Governance Journey
            </a>

        </section>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <%- include('partials/scripts') %>

</body>

</html>